      "content": "It is generally not safe to take high-dose Vitamin K supplements while on warfarin without doctor supervision. Vitamin K directly affects how warfarin works, as it interferes with the medication's ability to thin your blood. You must discuss this combination with your prescribing physician or healthcare provider to ensure your INR levels remain stable and safe.",
      "source": "target",
